      "title": "Method details",
      "instruction": "The method used in this study was carried out in several stages. The main stages are depicted in Fig. 1. The stages comprised Design, data collection, followed by data validation and process. The last three stages were Data Analysis, Reporting, and Publication.Fig. 1Research stages of the vocational education phenomena.Fig. 1",
